                "description": "The Large Bean Tip Entrance Door Mortise Lockset is for residential doors and is graded for exterior and interior use. The black finish and traditional bean shape grant this handleset a rustic appearance that makes it great for traditional decors of all types. It is available in single cylinder and dummy cylinder functions on doors that have a 2-1/2 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and measure 1-3/4 inches to 3 inches thick.",
